  "lineage": "Lam style of Savannakhet province in Laos, one of four lam styles sung there alongside lam ban sok, lam phu thai and lam tang vay. It is performed as a duet between a singer and a khaen player. Lam mahaxay, the regional style named for Mahaxay in neighbouring Khammouane province, is a related singer-and-khaen lam and is included in this entry.",
